<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Riverbank lighting pilot | Steering group</title>
  <style>{css}'"\\n{custom}</style>
</head>
<body>
<div data-lys aria-label=\"Riverbank greenhouse lighting pilot\">
  <article id=\"decision\" data-notes=\"The pilot observed a +6% median yield difference versus each site's reference plots, but plots were not randomly assigned and sites differed in crop mix and baseline conditions. The evidence supports learning whether the pattern repeats and collecting missing cost and energy data before considering wider installation. It does not establish that lighting caused the difference.\">
    <div class=\"slide\">
      <div class=\"topline\"><span class=\"kicker\">Riverbank · steering group</span><span class=\"issue\">Decision brief / 01</span></div>
      <main>
        <section class=\"left\" aria-label=\"Pilot result\">
          <h1>What should we do next?</h1>
          <p class=\"verdict\"><strong>Authorize one more measurement cycle.</strong> The pilot is promising enough to investigate further, but it does not yet support wider installation.</p>
          <div class=\"chartbox\" aria-label=\"Yield difference range from minus 3 percent to plus 14 percent, with a median of plus 6 percent\">
            <div class=\"chart-title\">Yield difference vs each site’s reference plots</div>
            <div class=\"range\" aria-hidden=\"true\">
              <div class=\"track\"></div><div class=\"rangebar\"></div><div class=\"median\"></div><div class=\"median-label\">Median +6%</div>
            </div>
            <div class=\"axis\"><span>−3%</span><span>0</span><span>+14%</span></div>
            <div class=\"chart-foot\"><strong>12 of 18 plots positive</strong><span>6 of 18 were not</span></div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class=\"right\" aria-label=\"Scope, limits, and proposed decision\">
          <div class=\"card\">
            <h2>What the pilot covered</h2>
            <p><strong>18 greenhouse plots</strong> · 3 sites · 1 winter growing cycle</p>
          </div>
          <div class=\"card limits\">
            <h2>Read the result with care</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>Plots were not randomly assigned.</li>
              <li>Crop mix and baseline conditions differed by site.</li>
              <li>Yield differences are observed associations; the pilot does not show lighting caused them.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class=\"card action\">
            <h2>Decision requested</h2>
            <p>Approve another cycle to check whether yield patterns repeat and measure <strong>installation cost</strong> and <strong>energy use</strong> before any wider-installation decision.</p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>
      <div class=\"foot\"><span class=\"source\">Pilot evidence only · Median and plot range are descriptive, not a causal estimate.</span><span>Riverbank lighting pilot</span></div>
    </div>
  </article>
</div>
<script>{js}</script>
</body>
</html>
'''
(root / 'output/slide.html').write_text(html)
decision = {
  \"protocol\": \"kata-eval-decision/v1\",
  \"audience_question\": \"What does the pilot evidence support the steering group doing next?\",
  \"form\": \"decision slide with a range-and-median evidence graphic\",
  \"fit_rationale\": \"A single decision slide pairs the pilot's measured yield spread and positive-plot count with its scope and design limits, then makes the supported next action explicit: another measurement cycle that captures the missing cost and energy data.\",
  \"tradeoff\": \"The compact range graphic highlights the overall spread and median but does not show each plot's individual value.\",
  \"caveats\": [
    \"The pilot covered 18 plots at three sites over one winter growing cycle.\",
    \"Plots were not randomly assigned, and crop mix and baseline conditions differed between sites; the observed yield differences do not establish that lighting caused them.\",
    \"Installation cost and energy use were not measured, so yield alone does not support wider installation.\"
  ]
}
(root / 'output/decision.json').write_text(json.dumps(decision, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2) + '\\n')
